<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves rise in August.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, rose 182 million dollars to 22.60 billion in August, compared with July, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>(In millions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  August 1996    July 1996</p>
<p> Change in reserves		    +182	    -401</p>
<p> Total net forex reserves	   22,599	  22,417 (r)</p>
<p>(r=revised)</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
